  "prefLabel": "Ed 306.03 Statutory Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 306.03 Statutory Requirements. For a school to be an approved school under these rules, the school board shall comply with all applicable state laws and rules.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1, #2, #3, and #4 at part heading for Ed 306) #14150, eff 12-13-24",
